      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For maintaining a luxury atmosphere, train staff to recognize incongruent behaviors, such as overly aggressive questioning of staff or exhibiting pronounced signs of intoxication. Be mindful of guests who appear visibly distressed or are engaging in loud, disruptive conversations in common areas. Keep an eye out for individuals who are excessively curious about internal property operations or are accompanied by groups exhibiting confrontational energy. These subtle indicators can help your team proactively manage the guest experience to uphold your elite standards.",
